## Interface: 16001
## Title: Blind Tiger
## Notes: Your guild's back room for WoW Forever: DKP and loot, raid sign-ups, roster, crafting orders, BiS and auction upgrades, raid kit, call-outs and summons, plus a Party button, Drink of the Night and play chips. For guilds only. Made by Kitch, of the Blood Pact guild, US East PvP Horde. Fan-made; not affiliated with Blizzard Entertainment.
## Author: Kitch (Blood Pact guild, US East PvP Horde)
